<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-σπάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw the contrary way, hold back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὁρμώμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					339
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μὲν τείνειν τοὺς δ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					493
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				542a15
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>suffer a check,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1409b21
			</span></i>; <i>to be drawn in a contrary direction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.53U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.171
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδοι -σπώμεναι</span>”
				<i>dragging,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.95S.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draw to itself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς αὑτό</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					929a39
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>draw over to one's own side,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.10.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντέχομαι</span>
			, <i>seize,</i> c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.598
			</span></i>.</div>
